## Interface: 16001
## Title: Dungeon Maps
## Notes: Dungeon maps for WoW: Forever: inside a dungeon your map key opens a big map of the floor with bosses, your group, and (with the Dungeon Maps tracker) live arrows. Outside, the key works as normal.
